<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LinearLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:app="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto"
    xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools"
    android:id="@+id/raiz"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="match_parent"
    android:orientation="vertical"
    tools:context=".SensorActivity">

    <com.google.android.material.appbar.MaterialToolbar
        android:id="@+id/toolbar"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:minHeight="?attr/actionBarSize" />

    <androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="0dp"
        android:layout_weight="1">

        <LinearLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:orientation="vertical"
            android:padding="16dp">

            <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView
                style="?attr/materialCardViewFilledStyle"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginBottom="12dp">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="16dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="0dp"
                        android:text="📘 O que esta tela demonstra"
                        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceTitleSmall"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="6dp"
                        android:text="Padrão Observer na prática: a tela NÃO pergunta ao sensor se algo mudou (polling). Ela se inscreve com um SensorEventListener e o sistema a avisa em onSensorChanged(). A inscrição é feita no onResume() e cancelada no onPause(), evitando gasto de bateria e Memory Leak."
                        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceBodyMedium"
                        android:lineSpacingExtra="2dp" />

                </LinearLayout>
            </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>

            <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView
                style="?attr/materialCardViewElevatedStyle"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginBottom="12dp">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="16dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/txtStatusListener"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="0dp"
                        android:text="● LISTENER CANCELADO — CPU ociosa"
                        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceTitleSmall"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/txtInfoSensor"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="6dp"
                        android:text="Carregando informações do sensor..."
                        android:fontFamily="monospace"
                        android:textSize="12sp" />

                </LinearLayout>
            </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>

            <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView
                style="?attr/materialCardViewElevatedStyle"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginBottom="12dp">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="16dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="0dp"
                        android:text="Valores em tempo real (onSensorChanged)"
                        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceTitleSmall"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="10dp"
                        android:gravity="center_vertical"
                        android:orientation="horizontal">

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="32dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="X"
                            android:textColor="#E53935"
                            android:textSize="22sp"
                            android:textStyle="bold" />

                        <TextView
                            android:id="@+id/txtX"
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:fontFamily="monospace"
                            android:text="+0.00"
                            android:textSize="26sp"
                            android:textStyle="bold" />

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="m/s²" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <com.google.android.material.progressindicator.LinearProgressIndicator
                        android:id="@+id/barraX"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:max="100"
                        android:progress="50"
                        app:indicatorColor="#E53935"
                        app:trackCornerRadius="4dp"
                        app:trackThickness="8dp" />

                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="10dp"
                        android:gravity="center_vertical"
                        android:orientation="horizontal">

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="32dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="Y"
                            android:textColor="#43A047"
                            android:textSize="22sp"
                            android:textStyle="bold" />

                        <TextView
                            android:id="@+id/txtY"
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:fontFamily="monospace"
                            android:text="+0.00"
                            android:textSize="26sp"
                            android:textStyle="bold" />

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="m/s²" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <com.google.android.material.progressindicator.LinearProgressIndicator
                        android:id="@+id/barraY"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:max="100"
                        android:progress="50"
                        app:indicatorColor="#43A047"
                        app:trackCornerRadius="4dp"
                        app:trackThickness="8dp" />

                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="10dp"
                        android:gravity="center_vertical"
                        android:orientation="horizontal">

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="32dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="Z"
                            android:textColor="#1E88E5"
                            android:textSize="22sp"
                            android:textStyle="bold" />

                        <TextView
                            android:id="@+id/txtZ"
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:fontFamily="monospace"
                            android:text="+0.00"
                            android:textSize="26sp"
                            android:textStyle="bold" />

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="m/s²" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <com.google.android.material.progressindicator.LinearProgressIndicator
                        android:id="@+id/barraZ"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:max="100"
                        android:progress="50"
                        app:indicatorColor="#1E88E5"
                        app:trackCornerRadius="4dp"
                        app:trackThickness="8dp" />

                    <GridLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="6dp"
                        android:columnCount="2"
                        android:useDefaultMargins="true">

                        <TextView android:layout_width="0dp" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:layout_columnWeight="1" android:text="Magnitude" />
                        <TextView android:id="@+id/txtMagnitude" android:layout_width="0dp" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:layout_columnWeight="1" android:text="—" android:textStyle="bold" />

                        <TextView android:layout_width="0dp" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:layout_columnWeight="1" android:text="Eventos recebidos" />
                        <TextView android:id="@+id/txtEventos" android:layout_width="0dp" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:layout_columnWeight="1" android:text="0" android:textStyle="bold" />

                        <TextView android:layout_width="0dp" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:layout_columnWeight="1" android:text="Frequência real" />
                        <TextView android:id="@+id/txtHz" android:layout_width="0dp" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:layout_columnWeight="1" android:text="0 Hz" android:textStyle="bold" />

                    </GridLayout>

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/txtOrientacao"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="6dp"
                        android:text="Aguardando leituras..."
                        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceBodyLarge"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                </LinearLayout>
            </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>

            <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView
                style="?attr/materialCardViewElevatedStyle"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginBottom="12dp">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="16dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="0dp"
                        android:text="Frequência de entrega (samplingPeriod)"
                        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceTitleSmall"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <HorizontalScrollView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:scrollbars="none">

                        <com.google.android.material.chip.ChipGroup
                            android:id="@+id/chipsDelay"
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            app:checkedChip="@id/chipUi"
                            app:selectionRequired="true"
                            app:singleLine="true"
                            app:singleSelection="true">

                <com.google.android.material.chip.Chip
                    android:id="@+id/chipNormal"
                    style="@style/Widget.Material3.Chip.Filter"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:text="NORMAL (~5 Hz)" />

                <com.google.android.material.chip.Chip
                    android:id="@+id/chipUi"
                    style="@style/Widget.Material3.Chip.Filter"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:text="UI (~16 Hz)" />

                <com.google.android.material.chip.Chip
                    android:id="@+id/chipGame"
                    style="@style/Widget.Material3.Chip.Filter"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:text="GAME (~50 Hz)" />

                <com.google.android.material.chip.Chip
                    android:id="@+id/chipFastest"
                    style="@style/Widget.Material3.Chip.Filter"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:text="FASTEST" />

                        </com.google.android.material.chip.ChipGroup>
                    </HorizontalScrollView>

                    <com.google.android.material.materialswitch.MaterialSwitch
                        android:id="@+id/switchLeak"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
                        android:text="⚠ Simular erro: NÃO cancelar no onPause()" />

                    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
                        android:id="@+id/btnZerar"
                        style="@style/Widget.Material3.Button.OutlinedButton"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="6dp"
                        android:text="Zerar contador de eventos" />

                </LinearLayout>
            </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>

            <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView
                style="?attr/materialCardViewElevatedStyle"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginBottom="12dp">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="16dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="0dp"
                        android:text="Como comprovar no Android Profiler"
                        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceTitleSmall"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="6dp"
                        android:text="1. No Android Studio: View → Tool Windows → Profiler.&#10;2. Selecione o processo com.example.myapplication e abra a linha CPU.&#10;3. Com esta tela aberta (use FASTEST), a CPU mostra atividade constante.&#10;4. Aperte Home: o onPause() chama unregisterListener() e a CPU do app cai para ~0%.&#10;5. Ligue o modo de erro acima e repita: a CPU continua ativa com o app minimizado."
                        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceBodyMedium"
                        android:lineSpacingExtra="2dp" />

                </LinearLayout>
            </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>

            <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView
                style="?attr/materialCardViewElevatedStyle"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginBottom="12dp">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="16dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="0dp"
                        android:text="Log do ciclo de vida do listener"
                        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceTitleSmall"
                        android:textStyle="bold" />

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/txtLogSensor"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="6dp"
                        android:text=""
                        android:fontFamily="monospace"
                        android:textSize="11sp" />

                </LinearLayout>
            </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>

        </LinearLayout>
    </androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView>
</LinearLayout>
